                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Sure, we can add these along with code. I was thinking of directory layout as under -\n\ncommon - code which is common between modbus-rtu and modbus-tcp daemons.\nrtu - modbus rtu code/daemon\ntcp - modbus tcp/daemon (Not now, but when it gets worked on in future)\ntests - tests directory"
                }
